<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australian 13-week T-note yields 5.926 pct.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australian 13-week T-note yields 5.926 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of Australia said the result of this week's T-note tender was as follows:</p>
<p> 13-week -    Amount	Av. yield   Range	 Previous</p>
<p>		  AS500 million   5.926	 5.91-5.94   5.913</p>
<p>		  (RBA take-up nil, pct allotted at top 52)</p>
<p> 5-week  -    Amount	Av. yield   Range	 Previous</p>
<p>		  AS600 million   5.903	 5.88-5.91   5.891 (Feb 19)</p>
<p>(RBA take-up A$300 million, pct allotted at top 97)</p>
<p> 26-week -    Amount	Av. yield   Range	 Previous</p>
<p>		  AS300 million   5.946	 5.94-5.95   5.943</p>
<p>		  (RBA take-up nil, pct allotted at top 46)</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
